          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 82602,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Às vezes, precisaremos atualizar dados dentro de uma string sem criar uma string completamente nova. Como atualizar um especial de almoço diário.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"special = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Today's special is pasta&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Replace",
            "id": 82603,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos substituir uma parte de uma string armazenada dentro de uma variável, primeiro codificando o nome da variável e a instrução <code>replace()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"special = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Today's special is pasta&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"new_special = special.replace()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>replace</code> seguido de <code>(</code> e finalmente <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Values",
            "id": 82604,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dentro dos parênteses, adicionamos a parte que queremos substituir, como <code>\"pasta\"</code>, uma vírgula e, em seguida, o novo valor, <code>\"pizza\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"special = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Today's special is pasta&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"new_special = special.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;pasta&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;pizza&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"83\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>\"pasta\"</code> seguido de <code>,</code> e finalmente <code>\"pizza\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Passe para <code>replace()</code> o texto antigo, uma vírgula e o novo texto. Mude o especial de <code>pasta</code> para <code>pizza</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"special = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Today's special is pasta&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"new_special = special.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;pasta&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;pizza&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;special&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>\"pasta\"</code> seguido de <code>,</code> e finalmente <code>\"pizza\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Displaying",
            "id": 82628,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ao codificar <code>print(new_special)</code>, podemos ver que a variável <code>new_special</code> contém a string atualizada.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"special = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Today's special is pasta&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"new_special = special.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;pasta&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;pizza&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(new_special)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"104\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Today's special is pizza\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>print</code> seguido de <code>(</code> e depois <code>new_special</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A alteração foi armazenada em <code>new_special</code>. Exiba-a para que o console mostre <code>Today's special is pizza</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"special = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Today's special is pasta&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"new_special = special.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;pasta&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;pizza&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(new_special)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"special\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Today's special is pizza\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>print</code> seguido de <code>(</code>, <code>new_special</code> e finalmente <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "No change",
            "id": 82630,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ao codificar <code>print(special)</code>, podemos ver que o valor da variável original não muda.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"special = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Today's special is pasta&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"new_special = special.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;pasta&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;pizza&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(new_special)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(special)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"120\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Today's special is pizza\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Today's special is pasta\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>print(special)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Update",
            "id": 82629,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Em vez de criar uma nova variável, podemos reatribuir a variável original para a string atualizada codificando <code>special</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"special = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Today's special is pasta&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"special = special.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;pasta&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;pizza&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(special)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"45\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Today's special is pizza\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>special</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Occurrences ",
            "id": 82612,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando usamos <code>replace()</code> dessa forma, substituiremos todas as ocorrências do valor dentro da string, podemos ver isso aqui ao codificar <code>print(july)</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"june = \" /><text value=\"&quot;June sales target updated. Let's rock June!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"july = june.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;June&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;July&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(july)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"102\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"July sales target updated. Let's rock July!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>print</code> seguido de <code>(</code> e depois <code>july</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando usamos <code>replace()</code>, ele substitui todas as ocorrências de um valor dentro da string.</p><p>Exiba o resultado para que o console mostre <code>July sales target updated. Let's rock July!</code></p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"june = \" /><text value=\"&quot;June sales target updated. Let's rock June!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"july = june.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;June&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;July&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(july)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"june\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"July sales target updated. Let's rock July!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>print</code> seguido de <code>(</code>, <code>july</code> e finalmente <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question replace",
            "id": 82744,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que <code>replace()</code> faz?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Substitui uma parte de uma string por outro valor</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Cria uma string vazia</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Substitui uma parte de uma string por outro valor.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um nome de usuário contém <code>guest</code>. Você usa <code>replace()</code> para trocar essa parte por <code>member</code>. O que o método retorna?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Uma string com guest substituído por member</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Uma string vazia pronta para armazenar member</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">A posição onde guest foi encontrado</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Uma string com guest substituído por member.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question values",
            "id": 82745,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe no console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"age_group = \" /><text value=\"&quot;twenty-five to thirty&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"updated = age_group.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;thirty&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;thirty-five&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(updated)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"twenty-five to thirty-five\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">vinte e cinco a trinta e cinco</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">vinte e cinco a trinta</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">vinte e cinco a trinta e cinco.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Acompanhe a substituição antes de <code>updated</code> ser exibido. O que aparece no console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"age_group = \" /><text value=\"&quot;twenty-five to thirty&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"updated = age_group.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;thirty&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;thirty-five&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(updated)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"twenty-five to thirty-five\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">vinte e cinco a trinta e cinco</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">vinte e cinco a trinta</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">vinte e cinco a trinta-trinta e cinco</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">vinte e cinco a trinta e cinco.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question displaying",
            "id": 82746,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como podemos reutilizar o resultado dado por <code>replace()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Criando uma variável e armazenando-a dentro</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Não podemos reutilizar o resultado, pois ele sempre muda</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Criando uma variável e armazenando-a dentro.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Você precisa usar uma string atualizada novamente mais tarde no programa. Qual plano mantém disponível o resultado de <code>replace()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Armazene em uma variável o resultado retornado por replace()</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Chame replace() sem atribuir seu resultado</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Armazene novamente a string original depois de chamar replace()</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Armazene em uma variável o resultado retornado por replace().</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question no change",
            "id": 82747,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe no console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"answer = \" /><text value=\"&quot;The answer is Belgium&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"updated = answer.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Belgium&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;Finland&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(updated)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"The answer is Finland\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\">A resposta é Bélgica</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\">A resposta é Finlândia</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">A resposta é Finlândia.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>replace()</code> retorna uma string atualizada sem alterar a variável original.</p><p>Se você adicionar <code>answer = updated</code> após a substituição, quais valores as duas variáveis contêm?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"answer = \" /><text value=\"&quot;The answer is Belgium&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"updated = answer.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Belgium&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;Finland&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(updated)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"The answer is Finland\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">answer e updated contêm Finland</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">answer mantém Belgium, e updated contém Finland</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">answer contém Finland, e updated mantém Belgium</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">answer e updated contêm Finland.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Update",
            "id": 82748,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como podemos reutilizar a variável original após atualizar com <code>replace()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Podemos reatribuir a variável original para a string atualizada</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Não podemos reutilizar a variável original</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Podemos reatribuir a variável original para a string atualizada.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Uma variável chamada <code>status</code> armazena uma string. Qual passo faz <code>status</code> se referir à string retornada por <code>replace()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Atribua o resultado de status.replace() de volta a status</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Chame status.replace() sem uma atribuição</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Atribua status a outra variável antes de chamar replace()</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Atribua o resultado de status.replace() de volta a status.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Occurrences ",
            "id": 82749,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que acontece quando há múltiplas ocorrências de um valor em uma string ao usá-lo em <code>replace()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Todas as ocorrências do valor são substituídas</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Apenas a primeira ocorrência do valor é substituída</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Todas as ocorrências do valor são substituídas.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A string contém <code>go go</code>. O que <code>replace(\"go\", \"stop\")</code> retorna?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">stop stop</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">stop go</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">go go</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher stop stop.</p></body></html>"
