          {
            "title": "Example: Replace",
            "id": 82750,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Atualize a string chamando <code>replace()</code> para corrigir o erro de capitalização</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"answer = \" /><text value=\"&quot;The answer is INcorrect&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"updated = answer.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;INcorrect&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;incorrect&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(updated)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"60\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"The answer is incorrect\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>answer</code> seguido de <code>.</code> e depois <code>replace</code>, <code>\"incorrect\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Corrija a capitalização para que o console exiba <code>The answer is incorrect</code>, com <code>incorrect</code> todo em letras minúsculas.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"answer = \" /><text value=\"&quot;The answer is INcorrect&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"updated = answer.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;INcorrect&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;incorrect&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(updated)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Incorrect&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"The answer is incorrect\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>answer</code> seguido de <code>.</code>, <code>replace</code> e finalmente <code>\"incorrect\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Values",
            "id": 82751,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Substitua <code>\"Dollars\"</code> por <code>\"$\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"price = \" /><text value=\"&quot;50 Dollars&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"new_price = price.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Dollars&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;$&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(new_price)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"61\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"50 $\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>(</code> seguido de <code>\"Dollars\"</code> e depois <code>,</code>, <code>\"$\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Troque a palavra <code>\"Dollars\"</code> pelo símbolo <code>\"$\"</code> para que o console mostre <code>50 $</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"price = \" /><text value=\"&quot;50 Dollars&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"new_price = price.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Dollars&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;$&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(new_price)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Dollar&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"50 $\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>(</code> seguido de <code>\"Dollars\"</code>, <code>,</code> e finalmente <code>\"$\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
